# Keep the Docker build context small: another workspace names this checkout as a build context
# (`additional_contexts`) so that its `path = "../saci/crates/saci"` dependency resolves.
# The workspace manifests under `examples/` and `xtask/` stay: cargo loads every member of a path dependency's
# workspace, so a missing one fails the build.
target
**/target
.git
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.redb
**/*.redb
# cached tool binaries (the Tailwind standalone CLI of `cargo xtask ui`)
**/.tools
